# Pokémon Scarlet [0100A3D008C5C000] v4.0.0 - 512 Shadows (Paldea Native, DM_SHADOWS=low)

@flag print_values
@flag offset_shift 0x100

// The sun's shadow map at 512x512 instead of the game's 1024x1024. Where the game sizes the map (main+0x146e804): a size of 2048 becomes 1024
// (CMP W24, #0x800; B.NE; MOVZ W8, #0x400 at +0x146e80c; STR W8, [X19, #0x30]); here MOVZ W8, #0x200. Violet 4.0.0's main holds the same code there.

@enabled
0146e80c 08408052 // MOVZ W8, #0x200
@stop
